<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>OnePick Tools</title>
  <meta name="description" content="OnePick Tools - 粘贴一个或多个主流站点作品链接，按预设解析、诊断、下载和打包媒体文件。" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css?v=1.5.5" />
</head>
<body>
  <main class="shell">
    <nav class="nav">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="OnePick Tools">
        <span class="brand-mark">1P</span>
        <span>OnePick Tools</span>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#parser">解析</a>
        <a href="#platforms">平台</a>
        <a href="/config">状态</a>
        <div class="account-menu" id="account-menu">
          <button class="account-trigger" id="account-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="account-popover">账户</button>
          <section class="account-popover" id="account-popover" hidden>
            <div class="account-head">
              <span>当前用户</span>
              <strong id="account-user">加载中</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="account-actions">
              <button class="mini-button" id="token-show" type="button">查看 token</button>
              <button class="mini-button" id="account-edit" type="button">修改用户名/密码</button>
              <button class="mini-button danger" id="logout-button" type="button">登出</button>
            </div>
            <div class="token-box" id="token-box" hidden>
              <textarea id="account-token" readonly></textarea>
              <button class="mini-button" id="token-copy" type="button">复制 token</button>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <section id="parser" class="workbench">
      <div class="workbench-main panel">
        <div class="section-head command-head">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">OnePick Downloader</p>
            <h1>媒体解析工作台</h1>
            <p>粘贴单个作品链接，或一次粘贴多行分享文案。队列、预设、诊断和打包都在这里完成。</p>
          </div>
          <a class="button ghost compact" href="/config">Cookie / 代理</a>
        </div>
        <form id="parse-form" class="parse-form">
          <label class="input-label" for="input">链接输入</label>
          <textarea id="input" name="input" rows="7" placeholder="粘贴 YouTube / 抖音 / 小红书 / Bilibili / Vimeo 等作品链接；多行会自动批量解析。" required></textarea>
          <div class="parse-toolbar">
            <div>
              <span class="toolbar-label">输出预设</span>
              <div id="preset-panel" class="preset-panel" aria-label="输出预设">
                <button class="preset-button active" type="button" data-preset="best" data-mode="video" data-quality="best" aria-pressed="true">自动</button>
                <button class="preset-button" type="button" data-preset="2160" data-mode="video" data-quality="2160" aria-pressed="false">4K</button>
                <button class="preset-button" type="button" data-preset="1440" data-mode="video" data-quality="1440" aria-pressed="false">1440</button>
                <button class="preset-button" type="button" data-preset="1080" data-mode="video" data-quality="1080" aria-pressed="false">1080</button>
                <button class="preset-button" type="button" data-preset="720" data-mode="video" data-quality="720" aria-pressed="false">720</button>
                <button class="preset-button" type="button" data-preset="480" data-mode="video" data-quality="480" aria-pressed="false">480</button>
                <button class="preset-button" type="button" data-preset="360" data-mode="video" data-quality="360" aria-pressed="false">360</button>
                <button class="preset-button" type="button" data-preset="audio" data-mode="audio" data-quality="best" aria-pressed="false">音频</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit">解析</button><button class="button ghost" id="inspect-button" type="button">诊断</button></div>
          </div>
        </form>
        <div id="result" class="result" hidden></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="workbench-side">
        <section class="panel runtime-card">
          <div class="side-title">
            <p class="eyebrow">Live Runtime</p>
            <h2>运行状态</h2>
          </div>
          <div id="runtime-summary" class="runtime-summary">
            <article><span>平台</span><strong>加载中</strong></article>
            <article><span>专用解析器</span><strong>加载中</strong></article>
            <article><span>Cookie</span><strong>加载中</strong></article>
          </div>
          <p class="muted-text">优先专用解析器；未专用平台走 yt-dlp 通用解析。</p>
        </section>
        <section class="panel tips-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Workflow</p>
          <ol>
            <li>选预设</li>
            <li>粘贴链接</li>
            <li>失败项重试或诊断</li>
            <li>成功项统一打包</li>
          </ol>
        </section>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section id="tools" class="tool-grid">
      <article class="tool-card active">
        <span class="icon">↓</span>
        <h3>解析下载</h3>
        <p>视频、图集、音频和可公开访问媒体解析下载。专用解析器优先，通用解析兜底。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tool-card muted">
        <span class="icon">?</span>
        <h3>链接诊断</h3>
        <p>识别平台、重定向链路、主页误贴、登录/验证码等常见失败原因。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tool-card muted">
        <span class="icon">HQ</span>
        <h3>输出预设</h3>
        <p>解析前选择自动最佳、清晰度上限或仅音频，批量队列会沿用同一套预设。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tool-card muted">
        <span class="icon">ZIP</span>
        <h3>队列打包</h3>
        <p>多行链接自动逐项解析，失败项可单独重试，成功结果可统一归档为 ZIP。</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section id="platforms" class="panel compact-panel">
      <div class="section-head stack-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Live Status</p>
        <h2>支持平台</h2>
        <p>实时读取 parser 和 Cookie 配置。需要提升成功率时，优先补对应平台 Cookie 或代理。</p>
      </div>
      <div id="platform-status" class="platform-list mini"></div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <section class="account-dialog" id="account-dialog" hidden>
    <form class="account-dialog-card" id="account-form">
      <div class="cookie-editor-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Account</p>
          <h2>修改用户名/密码</h2>
        </div>
        <button class="mini-button" id="account-close" type="button">关闭</button>
      </div>
      <label for="account-username">用户名</label>
      <input id="account-username" name="username" autocomplete="username" required />
      <label for="account-current-password">当前密码</label>
      <input id="account-current-password" name="currentPassword" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required />
      <label for="account-new-password">新密码</label>
      <input id="account-new-password" name="newPassword" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" required />
      <button class="button primary" type="submit">保存并重新登录</button>
      <p class="muted-text" id="account-form-status"></p>
    </form>
  </section>
  <script src="/app.js?v=1.5.5" type="module"></script>
</body>
</html>
